+- New pure core:
+  - `road`: polyline arc-length maths;
+  - `kart-trip`: the trip state machine;
+  - `game-assets`: `loadPlan`, `AssetTracker` and `releasePlan`;
+  - `round-guard`, `motion` and `session-store`;
